<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's one-month T-bill yield drops to 19.61pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's one-month T-bill yield drops to 19.61pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 19.61 percent, down from 19.88 set at an auction held one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	5,468.02 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.61 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.5180 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
